    <briefdescription>
<para>OpenGL shader program wrapper. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Manages the compilation, linking, and usage of vertex and fragment shaders. Provides methods for setting uniform values (matrices, vectors, and floats).</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Shaders are compiled from source strings at runtime. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classGraphicsContext" kindref="compound">GraphicsContext</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
